{"id": "c3607bde-a32b-461a-b879-8a00c36962a6", "slug": "creative-platform", "title": "Creative Platform", "description": "Creative Platform Pricing Section is designed for comparing plans and supporting conversion decisions. Key features include plan comparison blocks and conversion-oriented actions. Built with custom CSS, it is suitable for subscription pricing pages and plan comparison experiences.", "content": "---\nversion: \"neuform-top-creators-featured\"\nname: \"Creative Platform\"\ndescription: \"Creative Platform Pricing Section is designed for comparing plans and supporting conversion decisions. Key features include plan comparison blocks and conversion-oriented actions. Built with custom CSS, it is suitable for subscription pricing pages and plan comparison experiences.\"\ncolors:\n  primary: \"#EAB308\"\n  secondary: \"#FFFFFF\"\n  accent: \"#4CD4C4\"\n  background: \"#FFFFFF\"\n  surface: \"#181926\"\n  text-primary: \"#111827\"\n  text-secondary: \"#4B5563\"\n  border: \"#E5E7EB\"\ntypography:\n  display-lg:\n    fontFamily: \"Inter\"\n    fontSize: \"64px\"\n    fontWeight: 500\n    lineHeight: \"1.04\"\n    letterSpacing: \"0\"\n  body-md:\n    fontFamily: \"Inter\"\n    fontSize: \"16px\"\n    fontWeight: 400\n    lineHeight: \"1.6\"\n  label-md:\n    fontFamily: \"JetBrains Mono\"\n    fontSize: \"12px\"\n    fontWeight: 600\n    lineHeight: \"1.2\"\nspacing:\n  base: \"8px\"\n  gap: \"16px\"\n  card-padding: \"24px\"\n  section-padding: \"80px\"\nrounded:\n  card: \"8px\"\n  control: \"8px\"\n  pill: \"9999px\"\ncomponents:\n  card:\n    background: \"Use the surface token with subtle borders and HTML-matched shadow depth\"\n    radius: \"Match the declared card radius token\"\n  button:\n    background: \"Use primary or accent colors for the main action\"\n    radius: \"Use the control or pill radius based on the source HTML\"\n---\n# Creative Platform\nSource: Neuform Featured templates from top creators. Author: Aksonvady Phomhome (@aksonvady). Views: 3; favorites: 1; remixes: 1.\nTags: pricing, section, css, animated, plans, billing, conversion.\n## Overview\nCreative Platform Pricing Section is designed for comparing plans and supporting conversion decisions. Key features include plan comparison blocks and conversion-oriented actions. Built with custom CSS, it is suitable for subscription pricing pages and plan comparison experiences.\n\nE M A WORKSHOPS TUTORIALS PRICING 01 UI & UX Wireframing, prototyping, user testing, and many other important topics for modern design. FUNDAMENTALS NEW FIGMA 02 INTERACT WEBGL CREATIVE DEV 03 CODE 101 Modern frontend d…\n## Composition\nUse the attached HTML reference as the source of truth. Preserve the visible hierarchy, first-screen composition, section rhythm, density, and interaction tone before adapting copy or content.\nKey visible headings include: UI & UX; INTERACT; CODE 101.\n## Colors\nAnchor the palette in primary #EAB308, secondary #FFFFFF, accent #4CD4C4, background #FFFFFF, surface #181926, text-primary #111827. Keep background, surface, text, and border roles distinct so generated layouts retain the same contrast pattern as the source.\n## Typography\nUse Inter for display moments and Inter for body copy unless the HTML clearly demands a compatible fallback. Labels and technical metadata should use JetBrains Mono or an equivalent mono face.\n## Layout\nKeep spacing deliberate and stable. Favor the same grid direction, max-width behavior, card density, and responsive stacking seen in the HTML. Do not replace distinctive source structures with generic SaaS sections.\n## Components\nCards, buttons, badges, navigation, and repeated blocks should preserve the source geometry, border treatment, and hover feel.\n## Motion\nPreserve existing motion cues such as masked reveals, staggered entrance, hover lift, scroll-triggered transitions, and ambient movement. Keep easing smooth and restrained.\n## WebGL & Effects\n\nIf the source includes canvas, WebGL, Three.js, gradients, particles, or atmospheric effects, rebuild them as supporting layers behind the content. Keep effects performant, responsive, and secondary to the interface.\n\n## Guardrails\n- Do not flatten the source into a generic card grid.\n- Do not swap the color mode unless the source clearly supports it.\n- Preserve the first viewport signal, focal object, and visual density.\n- Keep buttons, cards, and badges aligned to the same radius and border language.", "preview_html": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"en\">\n<head>\n    <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n    <meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n    <title>Creative Platform</title>\n    <script src=\"https://cdn.tailwindcss.com\"></script>\n    <script src=\"https://code.iconify.design/iconify-icon/1.0.7/iconify-icon.min.js\"></script>\n    <link href=\"https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Inter:wght@300;400;500;600&display=swap\" rel=\"stylesheet\">\n    <script src=\"https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/gsap/3.12.2/gsap.min.js\"></script>\n    <script src=\"https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/gsap/3.12.2/ScrollTrigger.min.js\"></script>\n    <script src=\"https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/three.js/r128/three.min.js\"></script>\n\n    <script>\n        tailwind.config = {\n            theme: {\n                extend: {\n                    fontFamily: {\n                        sans: ['Inter', 'sans-serif'],\n                    },\n                    colors: {\n                        base: '#11121c',\n                        surface: '#181926',\n                        accent: '#4cd4c4',\n                    }\n                }\n            }\n        }\n    </script>\n</head>\n<body class=\"bg-base text-slate-200 font-sans overflow-x-hidden selection:bg-accent/30 selection:text-white\" style=\"-webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased; -moz-osx-font-smoothing: grayscale;\">\n\n    <!-- Top Navigation -->\n    <header class=\"fixed top-0 left-0 w-full z-50 flex items-center justify-between px-8 py-6 bg-base/80 backdrop-blur-md border-b border-white/5\" style=\"border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.05);\">\n        <div class=\"flex items-center gap-4\">\n            <span class=\"text-xs font-medium tracking-widest text-slate-400\">E</span>\n            <div class=\"w-8 h-8 rounded-full border-[1.5px] border-accent flex items-center justify-center relative\">\n                <div class=\"w-4 h-4 rounded-full border-[1.5px] border-white\"></div>\n                <div class=\"absolute -right-1 top-1/2 -translate-y-1/2 w-2 h-2 bg-base rounded-full\"></div>\n            </div>\n            <span class=\"text-xs font-medium tracking-widest text-slate-400\">M</span>\n            <span class=\"text-xs font-medium tracking-widest text-slate-400\">A</span>\n        </div>\n\n        <nav class=\"hidden md:flex items-center gap-12 text-xs font-medium tracking-widest text-slate-300\">\n            <a href=\"#\" class=\"hover:text-white transition-colors\">WORKSHOPS</a>\n            <span class=\"w-1 h-1 rounded-full bg-slate-700\"></span>\n            <a href=\"#\" class=\"hover:text-white transition-colors\">TUTORIALS</a>\n            <span class=\"w-1 h-1 rounded-full bg-slate-700\"></span>\n            <a href=\"#\" class=\"hover:text-white transition-colors\">PRICING</a>\n        </nav>\n\n        <button class=\"text-slate-300 hover:text-accent transition-colors\">\n            <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:hamburger-menu-linear\" width=\"24\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"></iconify-icon>\n        </button>\n    </header>\n\n    <!-- Right Social Sidebar -->\n    <aside class=\"fixed right-0 top-0 h-full w-16 border-l border-white/5 hidden lg:flex flex-col items-center justify-end pb-12 gap-8 z-40 bg-base/50 backdrop-blur-sm\" style=\"border-left: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.05);\">\n        <a href=\"#\" class=\"text-accent hover:text-white transition-colors\"><iconify-icon icon=\"solar:twitter-linear\" width=\"18\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"></iconify-icon></a>\n        <span class=\"w-1 h-1 rounded-full bg-slate-700\"></span>\n        <a href=\"#\" class=\"text-accent hover:text-white transition-colors\"><iconify-icon icon=\"solar:play-linear\" width=\"18\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"></iconify-icon></a>\n        <span class=\"w-1 h-1 rounded-full bg-slate-700\"></span>\n        <a href=\"#\" class=\"text-accent hover:text-white transition-colors\"><iconify-icon icon=\"solar:tag-horizontal-linear\" width=\"18\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"></iconify-icon></a>\n    </aside>\n\n    <main class=\"pt-24 lg:pt-32 pb-24 lg:pr-16 w-full flex flex-col\">\n\n        <!-- Section 01 -->\n        <section class=\"w-full border-t border-b border-white/5 relative group\" style=\"border-color: rgba(255,255,255,0.05);\">\n            <div class=\"max-w-[1400px] mx-auto px-6 lg:px-12 py-16 lg:py-24 flex flex-col lg:flex-row lg:items-center gap-12 lg:gap-16\">\n                <!-- Number -->\n                <div class=\"w-12\">\n                    <span class=\"text-lg text-slate-500 font-medium relative pb-2 inline-block after:content-[''] after:absolute after:bottom-0 after:left-0 after:w-full after:h-[1px] after:bg-slate-500\">01</span>\n                </div>\n\n                <!-- Title -->\n                <div class=\"lg:w-[400px] shrink-0\">\n                    <h2 class=\"text-6xl md:text-8xl font-semibold tracking-tighter uppercase word-reveal\">UI & UX</h2>\n                </div>\n\n                <!-- Info -->\n                <div class=\"flex-1 flex items-start gap-6 max-w-sm\">\n                    <div class=\"w-12 h-12 rounded-full flex items-center justify-center shrink-0 text-slate-300\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(#11121c, #11121c) padding-box, linear-gradient(135deg, rgba(255,255,255,0.4), rgba(255,255,255,0.05)) border-box; border: 1px solid transparent;\">\n                        <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:lightbulb-bolt-linear\" width=\"24\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"></iconify-icon>\n                    </div>\n                    <p class=\"text-sm text-slate-400 leading-relaxed font-normal\">Wireframing, prototyping, user testing, and many other important topics for modern design.</p>\n                </div>\n\n                <!-- Tags -->\n                <div class=\"flex flex-row lg:flex-col gap-3 shrink-0 flex-wrap\">\n                    <div class=\"flex items-center gap-2 px-4 py-2 rounded-full text-xs font-medium text-slate-300 w-fit\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(#11121c, #11121c) padding-box, linear-gradient(135deg, rgba(255,255,255,0.2), rgba(255,255,255,0.02)) border-box; border: 1px solid transparent;\">\n                        <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:layers-minimalistic-linear\" width=\"14\" class=\"text-[#eab308]\"></iconify-icon>\n                        FUNDAMENTALS\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"flex items-center gap-2 px-4 py-2 rounded-full text-xs font-medium text-slate-300 w-fit\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(#11121c, #11121c) padding-box, linear-gradient(135deg, rgba(255,255,255,0.2), rgba(255,255,255,0.02)) border-box; border: 1px solid transparent;\">\n                        <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:star-fall-linear\" width=\"14\" class=\"text-[#eab308]\"></iconify-icon>\n                        NEW\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"flex items-center gap-2 px-4 py-2 rounded-full text-xs font-medium text-slate-300 w-fit\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(#11121c, #11121c) padding-box, linear-gradient(135deg, rgba(255,255,255,0.2), rgba(255,255,255,0.02)) border-box; border: 1px solid transparent;\">\n                        <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:pen-new-square-linear\" width=\"14\" class=\"text-[#eab308]\"></iconify-icon>\n                        FIGMA\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n\n                <!-- Action -->\n                <div class=\"lg:ml-auto\">\n                    <button class=\"w-16 h-16 rounded-full flex items-center justify-center text-white hover:bg-white/5 transition-colors group-hover:border-accent/50\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(#11121c, #11121c) padding-box, linear-gradient(135deg, rgba(255,255,255,0.2), rgba(255,255,255,0.05)) border-box; border: 1px solid transparent;\">\n                        <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:alt-arrow-right-linear\" width=\"20\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"></iconify-icon>\n                    </button>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n        </section>\n\n        <!-- Section 02 with WebGL -->\n        <section class=\"w-full border-b border-white/5 relative overflow-hidden group bg-surface/30\" style=\"border-color: rgba(255,255,255,0.05);\">\n            <!-- WebGL Container -->\n            <div id=\"webgl-container\" class=\"absolute inset-0 z-0 opacity-70 pointer-events-none mix-blend-screen\"></div>\n\n            <!-- Radial Gradient Overlay to blend edges -->\n            <div class=\"absolute inset-0 z-0 bg-[radial-gradient(circle_at_center,transparent_0%,#11121c_80%)] pointer-events-none\"></div>\n\n            <div class=\"max-w-[1400px] mx-auto px-6 lg:px-12 py-16 lg:py-28 flex flex-col lg:flex-row lg:items-center gap-12 lg:gap-16 relative z-10\">\n                <!-- Number -->\n                <div class=\"w-12\">\n                    <span class=\"text-lg text-slate-500 font-medium relative pb-2 inline-block after:content-[''] after:absolute after:bottom-0 after:left-0 after:w-full after:h-[1px] after:bg-slate-500\">02</span>\n                </div>\n\n                <!-- Title -->\n                <div class=\"lg:w-[400px] shrink-0\">\n                    <h2 class=\"text-6xl md:text-8xl font-semibold tracking-tighter uppercase word-reveal text-white\">INTERACT</h2>\n                </div>\n\n                <!-- Spacer to push tags right (acting like the visual space in ref) -->\n                <div class=\"flex-1 hidden lg:block\"></div>\n\n                <!-- Tags -->\n                <div class=\"flex flex-row lg:flex-col gap-3 shrink-0 flex-wrap\">\n                    <div class=\"flex items-center gap-2 px-4 py-2 rounded-full text-xs font-medium text-slate-200 w-fit backdrop-blur-md\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(rgba(17,18,28,0.7), rgba(17,18,28,0.7)) padding-box, linear-gradient(135deg, rgba(76,212,196,0.4), rgba(255,255,255,0.02)) border-box; border: 1px solid transparent;\">\n                        <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:magic-stick-3-linear\" width=\"14\" class=\"text-accent\"></iconify-icon>\n                        WEBGL\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"flex items-center gap-2 px-4 py-2 rounded-full text-xs font-medium text-slate-200 w-fit backdrop-blur-md\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(rgba(17,18,28,0.7), rgba(17,18,28,0.7)) padding-box, linear-gradient(135deg, rgba(76,212,196,0.4), rgba(255,255,255,0.02)) border-box; border: 1px solid transparent;\">\n                        <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:code-square-linear\" width=\"14\" class=\"text-accent\"></iconify-icon>\n                        CREATIVE DEV\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n\n                <!-- Action -->\n                <div class=\"lg:ml-auto\">\n                    <button class=\"w-16 h-16 rounded-full flex items-center justify-center text-white backdrop-blur-md hover:bg-white/5 transition-colors group-hover:border-accent\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(rgba(17,18,28,0.7), rgba(17,18,28,0.7)) padding-box, linear-gradient(135deg, rgba(76,212,196,0.6), rgba(255,255,255,0.1)) border-box; border: 1px solid transparent;\">\n                        <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:alt-arrow-right-linear\" width=\"20\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"></iconify-icon>\n                    </button>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n        </section>\n\n        <!-- Section 03 -->\n        <section class=\"w-full border-b border-white/5 relative group\" style=\"border-color: rgba(255,255,255,0.05);\">\n            <div class=\"max-w-[1400px] mx-auto px-6 lg:px-12 py-16 lg:py-24 flex flex-col lg:flex-row lg:items-center gap-12 lg:gap-16\">\n                <!-- Number -->\n                <div class=\"w-12\">\n                    <span class=\"text-lg text-slate-500 font-medium relative pb-2 inline-block after:content-[''] after:absolute after:bottom-0 after:left-0 after:w-full after:h-[1px] after:bg-slate-500\">03</span>\n                </div>\n\n                <!-- Title -->\n                <div class=\"lg:w-[400px] shrink-0\">\n                    <h2 class=\"text-6xl md:text-8xl font-semibold tracking-tighter uppercase word-reveal\">CODE 101</h2>\n                </div>\n\n                <!-- Info -->\n                <div class=\"flex-1 flex items-start gap-6 max-w-sm\">\n                    <div class=\"w-12 h-12 rounded-full flex items-center justify-center shrink-0 text-slate-300\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(#11121c, #11121c) padding-box, linear-gradient(135deg, rgba(255,255,255,0.4), rgba(255,255,255,0.05)) border-box; border: 1px solid transparent;\">\n                        <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:shield-star-linear\" width=\"24\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"></iconify-icon>\n                    </div>\n                    <p class=\"text-sm text-slate-400 leading-relaxed font-normal\">Modern frontend development course from industry expert, Jane Doe.</p>\n                </div>\n\n                <!-- Tags -->\n                <div class=\"flex flex-row lg:flex-col gap-3 shrink-0 flex-wrap\">\n                    <div class=\"flex items-center gap-2 px-4 py-2 rounded-full text-xs font-medium text-slate-300 w-fit\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(#11121c, #11121c) padding-box, linear-gradient(135deg, rgba(255,255,255,0.2), rgba(255,255,255,0.02)) border-box; border: 1px solid transparent;\">\n                        <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:monitor-linear\" width=\"14\" class=\"text-[#eab308]\"></iconify-icon>\n                        FULL COURSE\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"flex items-center gap-2 px-4 py-2 rounded-full text-xs font-medium text-slate-300 w-fit\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(#11121c, #11121c) padding-box, linear-gradient(135deg, rgba(255,255,255,0.2), rgba(255,255,255,0.02)) border-box; border: 1px solid transparent;\">\n                        <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:diploma-verified-linear\" width=\"14\" class=\"text-[#eab308]\"></iconify-icon>\n                        CERTIFIED\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n\n                <!-- Action -->\n                <div class=\"lg:ml-auto\">\n                    <button class=\"w-16 h-16 rounded-full flex items-center justify-center text-white hover:bg-white/5 transition-colors group-hover:border-accent/50\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(#11121c, #11121c) padding-box, linear-gradient(135deg, rgba(255,255,255,0.2), rgba(255,255,255,0.05)) border-box; border: 1px solid transparent;\">\n                        <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:alt-arrow-right-linear\" width=\"20\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"></iconify-icon>\n                    </button>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n        </section>\n\n    </main>\n\n    <script>\n        // Register ScrollTrigger\n        gsap.registerPlugin(ScrollTrigger);\n\n        // --- 1. Masked Word Reveal Logic ---\n        document.querySelectorAll('.word-reveal').forEach(element => {\n            const text = element.innerText;\n            const words = text.split(' ');\n            element.innerHTML = '';\n\n            words.forEach(word => {\n                const wrapper = document.createElement('span');\n                // Use inline styles for strict compliance to avoid <style> tags\n                wrapper.style.display = 'inline-block';\n                wrapper.style.overflow = 'hidden';\n                wrapper.style.verticalAlign = 'bottom';\n                wrapper.style.marginRight = '0.2em';\n                wrapper.style.paddingBottom = '0.1em'; // Prevent descender clipping\n\n                const inner = document.createElement('span');\n                inner.style.display = 'inline-block';\n                inner.style.transform = 'translateY(110%)';\n                inner.innerText = word;\n                inner.className = 'word-inner';\n\n                wrapper.appendChild(inner);\n                element.appendChild(wrapper);\n            });\n\n            // Create animation for this specific header\n            gsap.to(element.querySelectorAll('.word-inner'), {\n                y: '0%',\n                duration: 0.8,\n                ease: 'power3.out',\n                stagger: 0.1,\n                scrollTrigger: {\n                    trigger: element,\n                    start: 'top 85%',\n                }\n            });\n        });\n\n        // --- 2. Performant WebGL Background Logic ---\n        const initWebGL = () => {\n            const container = document.getElementById('webgl-container');\n            if (!container) return;\n\n            const scene = new THREE.Scene();\n            // Create camera matching container aspect\n            const camera = new THREE.PerspectiveCamera(45, container.clientWidth / container.clientHeight, 0.1, 1000);\n            camera.position.z = 30;\n\n            const renderer = new THREE.WebGLRenderer({ alpha: true, antialias: false });\n            renderer.setSize(container.clientWidth, container.clientHeight);\n            renderer.setPixelRatio(Math.min(window.devicePixelRatio, 2)); // Restrain GPU cost\n            container.appendChild(renderer.domElement);\n\n            // Create a twisting geometric particle system\n            const geometry = new THREE.TorusKnotGeometry(10, 3, 200, 32);\n\n            // Convert geometry to points\n            const particleMaterial = new THREE.PointsMaterial({\n                color: 0x4cd4c4, // Match accent color\n                size: 0.05,\n                transparent: true,\n                opacity: 0.6,\n                blending: THREE.AdditiveBlending\n            });\n\n            const particles = new THREE.Points(geometry, particleMaterial);\n            scene.add(particles);\n\n            // Interaction variables\n            let mouseX = 0;\n            let mouseY = 0;\n            let targetX = 0;\n            let targetY = 0;\n            const windowHalfX = window.innerWidth / 2;\n            const windowHalfY = window.innerHeight / 2;\n\n            // Track mouse movement over the specific section\n            const section = document.getElementById('webgl-container').parentElement;\n            section.addEventListener('mousemove', (event) => {\n                mouseX = (event.clientX - windowHalfX) * 0.001;\n                mouseY = (event.clientY - windowHalfY) * 0.001;\n            });\n\n            // Animation Loop\n            const clock = new THREE.Clock();\n\n            const animate = () => {\n                requestAnimationFrame(animate);\n                const elapsedTime = clock.getElapsedTime();\n\n                // Smoothly interpolate target rotation based on mouse\n                targetX = mouseX * 0.5;\n                targetY = mouseY * 0.5;\n\n                particles.rotation.y += 0.002;\n                particles.rotation.x += 0.001;\n\n                // Add subtle mouse interaction distortion\n                particles.rotation.x += 0.05 * (targetY - particles.rotation.x);\n                particles.rotation.y += 0.05 * (targetX - particles.rotation.y);\n\n                // Gentle pulsing effect on scale\n                const scale = 1 + Math.sin(elapsedTime * 0.5) * 0.05;\n                particles.scale.set(scale, scale, scale);\n\n                renderer.render(scene, camera);\n            };\n\n            animate();\n\n            // Handle Resize\n            window.addEventListener('resize', () => {\n                camera.aspect = container.clientWidth / container.clientHeight;\n                camera.updateProjectionMatrix();\n                renderer.setSize(container.clientWidth, container.clientHeight);\n            });\n        };\n\n        // Initialize WebGL after DOM is ready\n        window.addEventListener('DOMContentLoaded', initWebGL);\n    </script>\n</body>\n</html>", "preview_file_name": "creative-platform.html", "thumbnail_url": "https://hoirqrkdgbmvpwutwuwj.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/design-system-thumbnails/regenerated-2026-05-22-2s/creative-platform.jpg", "source_name": "creative-platform-DESIGN.md", "views": 86, "forks": 2, "private": false, "featured": true, "created_by": "2e815afb-cac1-4c01-90e1-cf3810246e35", "created_at": "2026-05-01T16:18:09.070118+00:00", "updated_at": "2026-06-30T10:01:39.238761+00:00"}